# Passkeys / app-domain association (Apple AASA): the file must be reachable EXTENSIONLESS at
# /.well-known/apple-app-site-association with Content-Type: application/json and no HTTP
# redirects. Netlify picks Content-Type by file extension, so the real file is stored as .json
# and this 200! rule rewrites the extensionless path to it INTERNALLY (a rewrite, not a
# redirect — Apple's requirement holds). assetlinks.json needs no rule: Android requests it
# by its real .json name.
/.well-known/apple-app-site-association    /.well-known/apple-app-site-association.json    200!

